#: ../../source/postcss_README.md:10
msgid ""
"PostCSS is a tool for transforming styles with JS plugins. These plugins "
"can lint your CSS, support variables and mixins, transpile future CSS "
"syntax, inline images, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss_README.md:14
msgid ""
"PostCSS is used by industry leaders including Wikipedia, Twitter, "
"Alibaba, and JetBrains. The [Autoprefixer] PostCSS plugin is one of the "
"most popular CSS processors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss_README.md:18
msgid ""
"PostCSS takes a CSS file and provides an API to analyze and modify its "
"rules (by transforming them into an [Abstract Syntax Tree]). This API can"
" then be used by [plugins] to do a lot of useful things, e.g. to find "
"errors automatically insert vendor prefixes."
msgstr ""

